<title>INDIA: India ICICI H1 96/97 results on Oct 22.</title>
<headline>India ICICI H1 96/97 results on Oct 22.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian long-term lending institution, Industrial Credit and Investment Corp of India (ICICI) said it will announce on October 22 its financial results for the six months ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
